# the dice (SEL): tapped alone, the page shown rolled; held with a page's button, that layer; held alone a second, the
# last roll undone. Garden's Tempo 72 (par18), Evolve 35 (par5), Motion 50 (par15); the bells' first modulator's
# depth 20 (par74), their Gate 25 (par168)
wait 300
tap SEL
wait 200
shot garden_dice.png
expect dirty 1
press SEL
wait 1100
release SEL
wait 100
expect par18 58
expect par5 40
expect par15 60
# SEL held with ARP: Voice 2 whole (its patch, how it plays, its modulators); undone as one
press SEL
tap ARP
release SEL
wait 200
shot bells_dice.png
press SEL
wait 1100
release SEL
wait 100
expect par74 30
expect par168 25
expect view 0
# on a voice's MOD page (1.4.5): all five, two to four on (the first two always: depths par32, par40), the rest Off
# (the fifth: depth par64, target par67)
tap ENV
tap ENV
tap ENV
tap ENV
tap ENV
tap ENV
wait 100
tap SEL
wait 200
shot mod_dice.png
expect par32 >9
expect par40 >9
expect par64 <1
expect par67 <1
# the reel's Tape Mod page: its five, two or three on (the first: target par201, depth par202), the fifth Off (par225,
# par226)
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
wait 100
expect view 9
tap SEL
wait 200
expect par201 >0
expect par202 >9
expect par225 <1
expect par226 <1
# 1.4.6: every page, every knob: rolled 8 times, none left unmoved (the player's own and the pickers aside)
expect diceunmoved 0
